<item><title>Asbestos Property Survey and reinspection</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Waimakariri District Council is seeking registrations of interest from suitably qualified and experienced asbestos surveying consultancies to support the next stage of its district-wide asbestos management programme. <br /><br />The opportunity covers a diverse portfolio of Council-owned buildings and structures and is expected to include surveys of previously unsurveyed pre-2000 assets, reinspections of known asbestos-containing materials, confirmatory sampling, and correction of existing survey and register information where required. The final delivery approach may comprise a combination of targeted reinspections and full management surveys, with priority given to unsurveyed properties and locations containing higher-risk materials.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 02/Sep/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2645<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Engineer, Research, Tech services, Real Estate & Property Services, Waste Management & Landfill<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
